            "notes": "Round 5 is where the build can diverge into 2 different routes. \n\nRoute A is buying [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) and [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) to focus on dumping as much damage as you can out in sustained fights while boosting up where possible. \n\nRoute B is buying [On Me!](item_cd2a0247-bc79-4f0b-b9ee-d985e3f9a9a7) if you're struggling to sustain yourself in fights with potentially [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) if you're getting bursted down by heroes like [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457), [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b) or [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424).",
